#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9441 expect=violation domain=TT
#note "Neither TTENRL nor TTDUR is present in the dataset, so no Repro Stage can carry an end rule or a planned duration - the state the parents' All gate and both R-5.25 siblings skip. Every Check leaf is a dataset-level var_exists fact, so Sensitivity derives Dataset and the absence is reported ONCE although both records lack the pair (wave E four-state decomposition; the M15 shape - the parent has no remaining condition to hoist)."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation
